        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/3bfbeaaccb36de1dc707b1858a7d71b2.apng?t=1759475635\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/3bfbeaaccb36de1dc707b1858a7d71b2.poster.avif?t=1759475635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=170 height=120 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 29-year-old ordinary guy, Ethan Syu works as an on-site computer engineer by day and runs a struggling personal video channel by night. On his way to a filming location, he gets into an accident. When he wakes up the next day, he discovers a mysterious user interface occasionally popping up in his vision, seemingly showing him the affection levels of certain people around him...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, players will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple story branches and make choices that shape the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with 3 unique characters, each with their own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase affection levels through dialogue choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the mysterious interface and reveal deeper plot elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience rich narrative content and unlock multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make affects how the story unfolds. As the affection levels change, Ethan's ordinary life will transform completely—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Some user interface elements are displayed in English by design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/b2b5121d9fc7c6772a32fdf5c0054715.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/b2b5121d9fc7c6772a32fdf5c0054715.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/c953fc2e9de583eb5d50a7a2d2a2750f.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/c953fc2e9de583eb5d50a7a2d2a2750f.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/09b9ecc283863e11a782e9ec574d2a71.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/09b9ecc283863e11a782e9ec574d2a71.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/b30528e70aa60cf87dae64cbfb87ba99.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/b30528e70aa60cf87dae64cbfb87ba99.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/3bfbeaaccb36de1dc707b1858a7d71b2.apng?t=1759475635\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/3bfbeaaccb36de1dc707b1858a7d71b2.poster.avif?t=1759475635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=170 height=120 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 29-year-old ordinary guy, Ethan Syu works as an on-site computer engineer by day and runs a struggling personal video channel by night. On his way to a filming location, he gets into an accident. When he wakes up the next day, he discovers a mysterious user interface occasionally popping up in his vision, seemingly showing him the affection levels of certain people around him...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, players will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple story branches and make choices that shape the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with 3 unique characters, each with their own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase affection levels through dialogue choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the mysterious interface and reveal deeper plot elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience rich narrative content and unlock multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make affects how the story unfolds. As the affection levels change, Ethan's ordinary life will transform completely—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Some user interface elements are displayed in English by design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/b2b5121d9fc7c6772a32fdf5c0054715.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/b2b5121d9fc7c6772a32fdf5c0054715.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/c953fc2e9de583eb5d50a7a2d2a2750f.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/c953fc2e9de583eb5d50a7a2d2a2750f.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/09b9ecc283863e11a782e9ec574d2a71.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/09b9ecc283863e11a782e9ec574d2a71.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/b30528e70aa60cf87dae64cbfb87ba99.avif?t=1759475635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras_big/b30528e70aa60cf87dae64cbfb87ba99.avif?t=1759475635 width=800 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
